# ProofGraph .gitignore — repo root is proofgraph/.
#
# What is ignored here agrees with linegate-exemptions.json's notion of
# "generated / not source": anything a runner regenerates or a package manager
# restores is excluded; committed fixtures, byte-checked schema projections
# (packages/schema/gen/), lockfiles, goldens, recordings, and the audit ledgers
# are NOT ignored — they ship.
#
# NOTE: gitignore does NOT support inline comments — a `#` after a pattern is
# treated as part of the pattern. Every explanatory comment below sits on its
# own line above the pattern it explains.

# ── Dependency trees (restored via `npm ci`; ~515MB, never committed) ────────
node_modules/

# ── Python bytecode / test caches (regenerated) ─────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.testtmp/

# ── Build outputs (regenerated by vite build / tsc / lake) ──────────────────
# app/dist (P3 build gate rebuilds), packages/*/dist (tsc)
dist/
# editor-shell/graph-view demo bundles (vite build)
demo-dist/
# vite transform cache
.vite/
# lean/lake toolchain build outputs (lake build regenerates)
.lake/
# cell 1 run artifacts (run_pipeline regenerates)
packages/graph-model/out/
# cell 3 run artifacts (every ExtractorCell.run regenerates)
packages/structure-extractor/out/

# ── Acceptance run artifacts (rewritten every `python acceptance/run_demo.py`)
# run_demo step 1 rewrites analysis-*.json BEFORE any gate reads them; the
# vitest.acceptance suite refuses loudly if they are absent, so a fresh clone
# regenerates them on the first acceptance run — they are never committed.
acceptance/analysis-*.json
acceptance/TRACE-full.json
acceptance/ACCEPTANCE-REPORT.md
# checks.json + ui-*.json + headless.json + parts (per-run)
acceptance/evidence/
# optional manual screenshots (not part of the gate)
acceptance/browser/

# ── Build-machine / session provenance — deliberately NOT shipped ────────────
# The durable content lives in README.md, SYSTEM-EXPLAINED.md and the
# vessels/REPORT-*.md round reports. The raw session transcripts and harness
# config leak local absolute paths / usernames / UUIDs and are excluded by
# choice (see README "Repository scope"). The workspace-root agentic-convos/
# and .claude/ sit ABOVE this repo root and are outside the repo already; the
# per-package copies below are inside it and must be ignored explicitly.
agentic-convos/
packages/*/agentic-convos/
.claude/

# ── Environment / secrets (never committed) ─────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*

# ── Editor / OS noise ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
